      "explanationHtml": "ההופכי של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span> מקיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a+x+ax=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=-\\frac{a}{1+a}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=-2</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתקבל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=-2</annotation></semantics></math></span>, שלם, ואכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∗</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-2)*(-2)=-2-2+4=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>. עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתקבל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\frac12</annotation></semantics></math></span>, עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתקבל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\frac23</annotation></semantics></math></span> ועבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתקבל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\frac34</annotation></semantics></math></span>, וכולם אינם שלמים, ולכן לאיברים האלה אין הופכי ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{Z}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
