      "explanationHtml": "הופכי קיים בדיוק כש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gcd(a,12)=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מתקיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>9</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gcd(9,12)=3</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9</annotation></semantics></math></span> אין הופכי. המספרים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5,7,11</annotation></semantics></math></span> זרים ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>≡</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\cdot5=25\\equiv1</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>49</mn><mo>≡</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7\\cdot7=49\\equiv1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>121</mn><mo>≡</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11\\cdot11=121\\equiv1</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
