       "promptHtml": "ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span> עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle f,g\\rangle=\\int_0^1 f(x)g(x)\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span> נתונות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=x</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(x)=3x+c</annotation></semantics></math></span>. עבור איזה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span> הפונקציות ניצבות ?",
       "explainHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle f,g\\rangle=\\int_0^1(3x^2+cx)\\,dx=1+\\frac c2</annotation></semantics></math></span>. השוויון ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span> נותן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c=-2</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
