      "questionHtml": "ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span> מגדירים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle f,g\\rangle=\\int_0^1e^x f(x)g(x)\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מהו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\|1\\|^2</annotation></semantics></math></span> ?",
      "explanationHtml": "המשקל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^x</annotation></semantics></math></span> נכנס לאינטגרל: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^1e^x\\cdot1\\cdot1\\,dx=e-1</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הערך <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא התוצאה בלי המשקל. הערך <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span> שוכח את הגבול התחתון. והערך <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{e-1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> מחלק בלי סיבה.",
