      "correctId": "a",
      "explanation": "$A^TA=(QR)^T(QR)=R^TQ^TQR=R^TR$. המכפלה $RR^T$ בסדר הפוך אינה שווה לה בדרך כלל (בדוגמה של $A=\\begin{pmatrix}3&5\\\\4&0\\end{pmatrix}$ היא $\\begin{pmatrix}34&12\\\\12&16\\end{pmatrix}$ לעומת $\\begin{pmatrix}25&15\\\\15&25\\end{pmatrix}$). הריבוע $R^2$ אינו סימטרי. והמטריצה $I$ היא $Q^TQ$, לא $A^TA$.",
      "recap": "$A^TA=R^TR$, ולכן $A^TA\\hat x=A^T\\vec b$ הופך ל-$R\\hat x=Q^T\\vec b$.",
      "questionHtml": "נתון <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=QR</annotation></semantics></math></span> עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q^TQ=I</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> משולשת עליונה. מהי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A^TA</annotation></semantics></math></span> ?",
      "explanationHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><msup><mi>Q</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A^TA=(QR)^T(QR)=R^TQ^TQR=R^TR</annotation></semantics></math></span>. המכפלה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR^T</annotation></semantics></math></span> בסדר הפוך אינה שווה לה בדרך כלל (בדוגמה של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center center\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>3</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>5</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>4</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;5\\\\4&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}</annotation></semantics></math></span> היא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center center\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>34</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>12</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>12</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>16</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\begin{pmatrix}34&amp;12\\\\12&amp;16\\end{pmatrix}</annotation></semantics></math></span> לעומת <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center center\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>25</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>15</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>15</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>25</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\begin{pmatrix}25&amp;15\\\\15&amp;25\\end{pmatrix}</annotation></semantics></math></span>). הריבוע <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^2</annotation></semantics></math></span> אינו סימטרי. והמטריצה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span> היא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q^TQ</annotation></semantics></math></span>, לא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A^TA</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
      "recapHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A^TA=R^TR</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>A</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A^TA\\hat x=A^T\\vec b</annotation></semantics></math></span> הופך ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R\\hat x=Q^T\\vec b</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
